      "statement": "In mcp-shared, tools.ts is the trust boundary: nothing outside it reads a tool's annotations, a tool runs as an observation only when the server declares readOnlyHint: true, everything else is queued for approval, and auto-applying a write additionally requires a vetted endpoint.",
