    {
      "id": "claim_1586bead351f4602b35f80b6a9bcd2ce",
      "statement": "The MCP trust tiers are 'vetted' (an administrator asserted the endpoint's annotations are reliable, so destructiveHint:false + idempotentHint:true may drive auto-approval) and 'byo' (a user typed the URL in; readOnlyHint still classifies reads but nothing else can auto-apply a write); gatekeeper-mcp-portal defaults to byo because the admin never saw upstream servers' annotations, and neither tier is shareable.",
